Z||000000||Pattyb||09-14-2000||03:45 PM||||  Just wanted to let you guys know of a group purchase I have on some dash kits.  These kits are made by Florida Auto Trim and you can get them in 8 synthetic finishes, 8 real carbon fiber, and 11 real wood. <BR>  <BR>  You can get the 8 piece kit for an auto or a manual which includes:<BR>1. AC Vent #1 <BR>2. AC Vent #2 <BR>3. Transmission Console (Auto or Man.) <BR>4. Main Speedometer Panel <BR>5. Radio/Blower Panel <BR>6. Auxiliary Gauge Panel <BR>7. Ash Tray Panel #1 <BR>8. Ash Tray Panel #2 <P>You can also get the following pieces:<BR>1. 2 Piece Glovebox Panels (If you have an aftermarket glovebox)<BR>2. 2 Piece Power Door Trim<BR>3. 1 Piece Auto Shifter Indicator (Automatic)<BR>4. 2 Piece Power Switch with Mirror Plug<P>If 10 people are interested in buying them than the price for 8 piece kit is $130.00 for the synthetics, and $170.00 for the real carbon fiber, and the real woods.  The glove box pieces are also $5.00 off the price if anyone wants one.  For more info and to see some of the different finishes you can go to  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/gtfieroracer/" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/gtfieroracer/</A> <P>If you are interested in buying one please email me at: JBrooke269@aol.com<BR>If you have any questions please post them on here since others probably have the same question.  I will keep everyone up on how many we have.<P>Im going to try to post a couple pictures later of what they look like installed.<P>Thanks, <BR> Pat<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||SloPonti||09-14-2000||09:25 PM||||i may be interested but i would nees to see some real pictures of it in a car and just plain pictures of the real kit! not just drawings! do  you have a link to some pictures?<BR>thanks<BR>Rob||||reg||1
