Z||000007||Pattyb||09-15-2000||06:35 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 286SE'S:<BR><B>Big deal, These were $130. for the synthetics 2 months ago when I was going to buy them. I wrote all the prices down. Now the price has gone up $10.00 and we are getting a "quantity break" at the old price? <BR>Not interested! </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes the price on them was $130 but I had to raise them up to $140 due to a rise in cost.  So I decided that I would offer them to the boards at the old price for people that wanted one. Its not like I raised the price to fool everyone.  Im sorry if you feel that this is unfair.<BR>Pat||||reg||1
